tyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 5:51 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:14</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
